**`app/main.py`** — Full rewrite with all new endpoints:

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Filtering** (`GET /tasks`) | Optional `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` query params — all combinable, applied sequentially |
| **Pagination** (`GET /tasks`) | `page` (default 1, ≥1) and `page_size` (default 20, ≥1) — slicing applied after filtering |
| **Create** (`POST /tasks`) | Requires auth via `Depends(require_api_key)`, validates `project_id` exists (404 if not), auto-generates ID, returns 201 |
| **Update** (`PUT /tasks/{task_id}`) | Requires auth, partial update via `exclude_unset=True`, 404 if task not found |
| **Delete** (`DELETE /tasks/{task_id}`) | Requires auth, returns 204 on success, 404 if not found |

